  (text "ESP32-C3FH4 core per Espressif ESP32-C3 schematic checklist (docs/esp32-c3-chip-design.md).\nRF: CLC match C32/L3/C33 at the chip, 50 ohm CPWG, pi footprint C34/L4/C35 at the Walsin\nRFANT3216120A5T (6.8nH series per datasheet). Tune on the real board. USB: native Serial/JTAG." (at 290 160 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
